   (slug biohub-x138 when we read it on 2026-09-22; now titled "Biohub 0.953 LB | ORIGINAL", version 1)
   License shown on the page: "This Notebook has been released under the Apache 2.0 open source license."
   SPDX: Apache-2.0. License text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

   Used in:
   - kaggle/x138_port_946.py: the flow-relink knob constants and the functions _gapfill_bump, load_low_detections,
     build_low_detection_pool, readmit_discarded_detections, fill_gaps_from_low_detections and motion_relink_edges
     (renamed _x138_flow_motion_relink_edges); the low-detection dump and ILP-timeout edits of the predict script.
